  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "海を越えて　飛来したらば　厳しき冬の終わりを知る。　慈愛が　ヒスイの地に新しき命　芽吹かせるとの　伝承あり。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "바다를 건너 날아와 혹독한 겨울의 끝을 알린다. 자애로움이 히스이 땅에 새로운 생명을 싹틔우게 했다는 전승이 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "當牠越過大海飛來，便代表嚴寒的冬季即將終結。傳說中其慈愛將使新的生命在洗翠大地上萌芽。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son arrivée par les mers annonce la fin des hivers rigoureux. On raconte que c’est l’amour que ce Pokémon ressent qui fait bourgeonner de nouvelles vies dans la région de Hisui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Kommt es übers Meer geflogen, neigt sich der harsche Winter dem Ende zu. Der Volksmund sagt, dass dank seiner Liebe neues Leben in Hisui Knospen treibe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su llegada de allende el mar significa el fin del duro invierno. De acuerdo con el folclore, su amor siempre trae consigo un soplo de vida nueva a Hisui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La sua venuta dai cieli al di là del mare annunzia la fine del rigido inverno. Si narra che il suo amore faccia germogliare nuova vita a Hisui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it flies to this land from across the sea, the bitter winter comes to an end. According to legend, this Pokémon’s love gives rise to the budding of fresh life across Hisui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
